### Certification

#### Earning Certificates

**Certificate Requirements**
- Complete all course lessons
- Pass final assessment (80% or higher)
- Submit and pass project assignments
- Meet minimum time requirements
- Complete course evaluation

**Certificate Features**
```markdown
🏆 Professional Design
📜 Verified Credentials
🔗 Shareable Links
📱 Digital Wallet
🌐 Blockchain Verification
📊 Detailed Transcript
```

**Sharing Your Certificate**
- **LinkedIn**: Add to your profile
- **Resume**: Include in CV
- **Portfolio**: Display in personal website
- **Social Media**: Share achievements
- **Employer Verification**: Provide to employers

