## Frequently Asked Questions

### General Questions

**Q: How long do I have access to courses?**
A: Once enrolled, you have lifetime access to purchased courses. Subscription plans provide access as long as your subscription is active.

**Q: Can I download courses for offline viewing?**
A: Yes, mobile app users can download lessons for offline viewing. Desktop users can download supplementary materials.

**Q: Are certificates recognized by employers?**
A: Yes, our certificates are industry-recognized and can be verified by employers through our blockchain verification system.

### Technical Questions

**Q: What are the system requirements?**
A: Modern web browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge), stable internet connection, and for mobile: iOS 12+ or Android 8+.

**Q: Can I use the platform on multiple devices?**
A: Yes, your progress syncs across all devices. You can switch between desktop and mobile seamlessly.

### Billing Questions

**Q: Can I get a refund?**
A: We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee for all course purchases. Subscription plans can be cancelled anytime.

**Q: Do you offer corporate plans?**
A: Yes, we offer custom enterprise solutions for teams and organizations. Contact our sales team for details.

